message: "If you use this research compendium, please cite it as below."
title: "Monitoring That the Instrument Cannot Provide: Measurement Inheritance and Tetracycline-Resistant Staphylococcus aureus in Doxycycline Post-Exposure Prophylaxis — research compendium"
abstract: >-
  Complete computational research compendium (code, coded data, and manuscript) supporting
  the measurement-inheritance analysis of doxy-PEP and bystander tetracycline-resistant
  Staphylococcus aureus. Contains no participant-level trial data.
type: software
